WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.996 --> 00:00:09.758
Long ago Bear had a beautiful tail.

2
00:00:11.479 --> 00:00:15.242
It was long and fluffy and kept him warm while he slept.

3
00:00:16.422 --> 00:00:18.984
But one day everything changed.

4
00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:22.607
Bear ran into a sneaky fox.

5
00:00:23.547 --> 00:00:27.050
And this fox liked to play tricks on everyone in the forest!

6
00:00:29.291 --> 00:00:33.533
One winter day Fox trotted across the frozen lake, looking for food.

7
00:00:35.474 --> 00:00:40.395
Suddenly she spotted a fisherman sitting by a hole in the ice.

8
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:47.777
"Yum!" Fox stared at the fisherman's long string of fish.

9
00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:51.558
"Those fish look delicious.

10
00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:58.200
I wonder if She crept closer.

11
00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:05.567
When the fisherman looked away—yank!

12
00:01:06.568 --> 00:01:08.389
Fox grabbed the string and ran.

13
00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:14.394
Meanwhile Bear was looking for food too.

14
00:01:14.414 --> 00:01:20.318
"I'd love to catch some fish," he said.

15
00:01:20.338 --> 00:01:23.740
"But the lake is frozen solid."

16
00:01:25.762 --> 00:01:28.224
Just then his eyes went wide.

17
00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:33.033
Fox was racing by with a long string of fish!

18
00:01:34.213 --> 00:01:36.334
Bear swished his tail in excitement.

19
00:01:39.935 --> 00:01:43.456
"Fox! You caught so many fish.

20
00:01:44.376 --> 00:01:45.717
I'm really hungry.

21
00:01:46.277 --> 00:01:48.237
Can you share some fish with me?"

22
00:01:48.257 --> 00:01:53.879
"Ha!" Fox laughed loudly.

23
00:01:53.899 --> 00:01:57.600
"This is my dinner, Bear.

24
00:01:58.292 --> 00:01:59.993
Catch your own fish!"

25
00:02:01.273 --> 00:02:02.194
Bear frowned.

26
00:02:02.214 --> 00:02:05.955
"But the lake is frozen solid.

27
00:02:06.576 --> 00:02:08.196
How can I catch fish?"

28
00:02:08.216 --> 00:02:10.617
"It's easy!"

29
00:02:11.838 --> 00:02:13.178
Fox hid her grin.

30
00:02:13.198 --> 00:02:17.680
"Follow me, and I'll show you what to do."

31
00:02:19.581 --> 00:02:21.602
Fox led Bear to the lake.

32
00:02:21.622 --> 00:02:25.824
"First, make a hole in the ice.

33
00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.361
Then, stick your tail in the hole.

34
00:02:30.321 --> 00:02:33.443
It will hurt when the fish bite," she warned.

35
00:02:33.463 --> 00:02:37.925
"But the longer you wait, the more fish you'll catch.

36
00:02:38.605 --> 00:02:42.927
When you think you've caught enough fish, give a strong, hard pull."

37
00:02:42.947 --> 00:02:46.688
"Got it!"

38
00:02:47.628 --> 00:02:48.609
Bear grinned.

39
00:02:49.749 --> 00:02:51.530
Then he did just what Fox said.

40
00:02:53.411 --> 00:02:55.992
Soon he felt a sharp pain in his tail.

41
00:02:57.672 --> 00:02:59.253
"Wow!" Bear said.

42
00:02:59.273 --> 00:03:01.915
"I caught a fish already."

43
00:03:01.935 --> 00:03:05.317
"Great!" Fox said.

44
00:03:05.337 --> 00:03:12.162
"Remember—leave your tail in the water for as long as possible.

45
00:03:12.643 --> 00:03:13.283
Good luck!"

46
00:03:14.864 --> 00:03:15.925
She ran off.

47
00:03:17.646 --> 00:03:20.608
Bear sat on the ice all afternoon.

48
00:03:21.609 --> 00:03:22.890
His tail hurt badly.

49
00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.772
But he did his best to ignore the pain.

50
00:03:26.756 --> 00:03:29.597
"After all, I'm catching lots of fish!"

51
00:03:30.097 --> 00:03:30.618
he thought.

52
00:03:31.578 --> 00:03:33.379
Finally Bear was ready to eat.

53
00:03:34.259 --> 00:03:36.380
He tried to pull his tail out of the ice.

54
00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.602
"Grr!" His tail did not move.

55
00:03:41.742 --> 00:03:43.403
He gave another hard pull.

56
00:03:44.403 --> 00:03:46.144
But again nothing happened.

57
00:03:46.884 --> 00:03:50.086
Then Bear pulled with all his might.

58
00:03:50.546 --> 00:03:55.688
Pop! "Oh no!"

59
00:03:56.568 --> 00:03:57.709
Bear spun around.

60
00:04:00.411 --> 00:04:03.314
Most of his tail was still stuck in the ice!

61
00:04:07.497 --> 00:04:09.139
He roared with anger.

62
00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.081
But it was too late.

63
00:04:14.904 --> 00:04:18.947
Ever since this day, Bear has had a stumpy tail.

64
00:04:23.304 --> 00:04:25.348
And Fox still laughs about her
